{
  "key": 18231,
  "messages": [
    {
      "id": "msg_0483_T06_00000",
      "en_US": [
        "Vermilion Port is Kanto’s\n",
        "seaside gateway.\r",
        "Luxury liners from around the world\n",
        "dock here."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0483_T06_00001",
      "en_US": [
        "My Pokémon is preparing the land\n",
        "for construction.\r",
        "But this odd tablet has stopped\n",
        "our progress..."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0483_T06_00002",
      "en_US": "Makuhita: Guooh gogogoh!"
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0483_T06_00003",
      "en_US": [
        "There are eight Gyms in Kanto.\r",
        "That big building is Vermilion’s\n",
        "Pokémon Gym."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0483_T06_00004",
      "en_US": [
        "Skilled Trainers gather in Kanto.\n",
        "Gym Leaders are especially strong.\r",
        "They won’t be easy to defeat."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0483_T06_00005",
      "en_US": [
        "You’ve started to collect Kanto\n",
        "Gym Badges?\r",
        "Don’t you agree that the Trainers\n",
        "here are tough?"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0483_T06_00006",
      "en_US": [
        "I guess you’ll be finished with your\n",
        "conquest of Kanto Gyms soon.\r",
        "Let me know if you get all\n",
        "eight Badges."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0483_T06_00007",
      "en_US": [
        "Congratulations!\n",
        "You got all the Kanto Gym Badges.\r",
        "I’ve got a reward for your efforts.\r"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0483_T06_00008",
      "en_US": [
        "PP Max is a powerful item that\n",
        "raises a move’s top PP to its maximum.\f",
        "It can change the way you battle!"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0483_T06_00009",
      "en_US": [
        "PP Max is a powerful item that\n",
        "raises a move’s top PP to its maximum.\f",
        "It can change the way you battle!"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0483_T06_00010",
      "en_US": [
        "Vermilion City\n",
        "The Port of Exquisite Sunsets"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0483_T06_00011",
      "en_US": [
        "Vermilion City Pokémon Gym\n",
        "Leader: Lt. Surge\f",
        "The Lightning American"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0483_T06_00012",
      "en_US": [
        "Pokémon Fan Club\n",
        "All Pokémon Fans Welcome!"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0483_T06_00013",
      "en_US": "Vermilion Port Entrance"
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0483_T06_00014",
      "en_US": [
        "Eusine: That was so close!\n",
        "I thought I could corner it by\f",
        "ambushing it here...\r",
        "But running on the water...\n",
        "is beyond me.\r",
        "Still, I am starting to see a pattern.\f",
        "Suicune prefers water!\f",
        "That means...\r"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0483_T06_00015",
      "en_US": [
        "Sorry, {STRVAR_1 3, 0, 0}!\n",
        "I’ve got to go!\r"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0483_T06_00016",
      "en_US": [
        "Steven: Oh, hello, {STRVAR_1 3, 0, 0}.\n",
        "I wasn’t expecting to find you here!\r",
        "Have you had any luck collecting more\n",
        "of the Plate items? I’ve read they may\f",
        "be connected to a mysterious place\f",
        "called the Mystri Stage. Maybe Cynthia\f",
        "can help with that...\r"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0483_T06_00017",
      "en_US": [
        "Steven: By the way, have you heard of\n",
        "a Pokémon called Latias?\r",
        "I’ve been investigating why Latias,\n",
        "a Pokémon from Hoenn, decided to\f",
        "leave Hoenn to come here.\r"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0483_T06_00018",
      "en_US": [
        "Steven: By the way, have you heard of\n",
        "a Pokémon called Latios?\r",
        "I’ve been investigating why Latios,\n",
        "a Pokémon from Hoenn, decided to\f",
        "leave Hoenn to come here.\r"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0483_T06_00019",
      "en_US": [
        "Latias is a Pokémon that has a lot\n",
        "to do with Soul Dew, a gemlike Orb.\r",
        "Considering the fact that Latias is now\n",
        "in Kanto, it is possible to assume that\f",
        "this has to do with the Soul Dew.\r"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0483_T06_00020",
      "en_US": [
        "Latios is a Pokémon that has a lot\n",
        "to do with Soul Dew, a gemlike Orb.\r",
        "Considering the fact that Latios is now\n",
        "in Kanto, it is possible to assume that\f",
        "this has to do with Soul Dew.\r"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0483_T06_00021",
      "en_US": [
        "Latias is a Pokémon that travels\n",
        "a great distance.\r",
        "It’ll be difficult to find without any\n",
        "machine to track it with.\r",
        "But any Trainer will be drawn to it,\n",
        "won’t they?\r"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0483_T06_00022",
      "en_US": [
        "Latios is a Pokémon that travels\n",
        "a great distance.\r",
        "It’ll be difficult to find without any\n",
        "machine to track it with.\r",
        "But any Trainer will be drawn to it,\n",
        "won’t they?\r"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0483_T06_00023",
      "en_US": [
        "Steven: While in the Kanto region, I’ve\n",
        "been staying in a house in Pewter City.\f",
        "You should come visit, if you have time!\f",
        "Particularly if you happen to find that\f",
        "Pokémon I just mentioned...\r",
        "May our journeys cross again!\r"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0483_T06_00024",
      "en_US": [
        "Are you looking to challenge the\n",
        "Vermilion Gym?\r",
        "Sorry, but our Gym Leader is\n",
        "currently absent.\r",
        "Why not check out the gyms in\n",
        "Pewter and Cerulean City?"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0483_T06_00025",
      "en_US": [
        "Say, isn’t that a Machine Part\n",
        "from the Power Plant?\n",
        "Shouldn’t you return it?"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0483_T06_00026",
      "en_US": [
        "A mysterious structure that has\n",
        "some odd words on it...\r",
        "{COLOR 2}Bring here th spir f eo.\n",
        "Wit and rt, eo shal me...{COLOR 0}\r",
        "The writing is faded, and hard to\n",
        "make out..."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0483_T06_00027",
      "en_US": "A rush of wind..."
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0483_T06_00028",
      "en_US": "Latias: Huaaaaann!\r"
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0483_T06_00029",
      "en_US": "Latias: Huaaaaann!\r"
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0483_T06_00030",
      "en_US": [
        "The {COLOR 2}Soul Dew{COLOR 0} appears to be reacting\n",
        "with the tablet and sending out a\f",
        "signal...\r",
        "If it attracts an Eon Pokémon, you’ll\n",
        "have {COLOR 1}only one chance{COLOR 0} to challenge\f",
        "it before it flies away.\r",
        "Are you prepared to continue?"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0483_T06_00031",
      "en_US": [
        "What’s this? The {COLOR 2}Enigma Stone{COLOR 0} appears\n",
        "to be changing form..."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0483_T06_00032",
      "en_US": [
        "My Pokémon is preparing the land\n",
        "for construction.\r",
        "With that tablet gone, we can\n",
        "continue our progress!"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0483_T06_00033",
      "en_US": "Latios: Shuaaaann!\r"
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0483_T06_00034",
      "en_US": "Huh?"
    }
  ]
}
